    "chunk_text": "as & namon hys lichaman & bebyrgdon hyne & comon & \u00d0a se H\u00e6lend \u00fe\u00e6t gehyrde \u00fea ferde; He \u00feanon onsundron on anum scype & \u00fea \u00fea gangendan & \u00fea he \u00feanon ferde, he geseh mycele m\u00e6nigu & he him gemiltsode & geh\u00e6lde \u00fea untruman. So\u00f0lice \u00fea hyt w\u00e6s \u00e6fen geworden; Him to geneal\u00e6hton hys leorningcnihtas & him to cw\u00e6don, \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to him, nabba\u00f0 hi neode to farenne; Sylle ge him etan. \u00dea andswarodun hig, we nabba\u00f0 her butun fif hlafas & twegen fixas. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend, bringa\u00fe me hider \u00fea. And \u00fea he het \u00fea menegu ofer \u00fe\u00e6t g\u00e6rs hi sittan & he nam \u00fea fif hlafas & twegen fixas & beseah on & hi \u00e6ton ealle & w\u00e6ron gefyllede; & hi namon \u00fea lafa twelf wylian fulle \u00fe\u00e6ra gebrytsena. So\u00felice \u00fe\u00e6ra etendra get\u00e6l w\u00e6s fif \u00feusenda wera butan wifum & cildum. And \u00fea sona het se H\u00e6lend his leorningcnihtas on scyp astigan & toforan him faran ofer \u00feone & \u00fea he hig forl\u00e6ten h\u00e6fde he eode on \u00feone munt & hyne \u00fe\u00e6r ana geb\u00e6d; So\u00felice \u00fea hyt \u00e6fen w\u00e6s Witodlice w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t scyp of \u00feam y\u00feum totorfod for\u00feam \u00fee hyt w\u00e6s strang wind. \u00dea com se H\u00e6lend embe \u00feone feor\u00fean hancred to him ofer \u00fea s\u00e6 gangende. \u00d0a hi gesawon \u00fe\u00e6t hi wurdon \u00fea ged",
